# Implementation Plan

**Milestone identity.** Replace the `<milestone-id>` placeholder in the frontmatter above with the id
your tracking mode allocates: in `mode: none` (tracker-less) it is **minted** locally as
`M_<short-ULID>`; in tracker mode it is a sequential `M<N>` taken from the milestone scan, or
`M_<epic-key>` where milestones mirror Epics. Never guess the next sequential number by eye — the id
is resolved for you when the plan is created. Delete this note once the value is filled in.

